<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina to auction $500 mln Bonte T-bonds.</title>
<headline>Argentina to auction $500 mln Bonte T-bonds.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina will auction $500 million of Bonte Treasury bonds on December 10, the Economy Ministry announced Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Bontes will mature on December 13, 1998 and will be sold through Dutch-style auction. Offers are due by 1400 local time/1700 GMT on auction day.</p>
</text>
